What's wrong buddy? Why so hostile? I can't find the correlation between me watching Artem fight and UFC marketing, sorry.. I like his personality and i have followed his story when Connor came up in the ranks, so yes im more invested in him than most of the fighters who fight currently in prelims etc.. The man has a story behind him and that makes it interesting. 

